{'symbol': 'MSCI', 'date': '2023-05-04 18:36:00', 'title': 'MSCI MAY INDEX REVIEW ANNOUNCEMENT SCHEDULED FOR MAY 11, 2023', 'text': 'LONDON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MSCI INC. (NYSE:MSCI), A LEADING PROVIDER OF CRITICAL DECISION SUPPORT TOOLS AND SERVICES FOR THE GLOBAL INVESTMENT COMMUNITY, WILL ANNOUNCE THE RESULTS OF THE MAY 2023 INDEX REVIEW FOR THE MSCI EQUITY INDEXES - INCLUDING THE MSCI GLOBAL STANDARD, MSCI GLOBAL SMALL CAP AND MSCI MICRO CAP INDEXES, THE MSCI GLOBAL VALUE AND GROWTH INDEXES, THE MSCI FRONTIER MARKETS, AND MSCI FRONTIER MARKETS SMALL CAP INDEXES, THE MSCI GLOBAL ISLAMIC AND MSCI GLOBAL ISLAMIC SMALL CAP INDE.'}{'symbol': 'MSCI', 'date': '2023-05-04 11:18:00', 'title': 'MSCI TO PARTICIPATE IN BARCLAYS AMERICAS SELECT FRANCHISE CONFERENCE', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MSCI INC. (“MSCI” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NYSE: MSCI), A LEADING PROVIDER OF CRITICAL DECISION SUPPORT TOOLS AND SERVICES FOR THE GLOBAL INVESTMENT COMMUNITY, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT BAER PETTIT, PRESIDENT, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT ON TUESDAY, MAY 9, 2023, AT 10:15 AM EASTERN TIME AS A PART OF THE BARCLAYS 15TH ANNUAL AMERICAS SELECT FRANCHISE CONFERENCE. A LIVE WEBCAST AND REPLAY WILL BE AVAILABLE ON THE EVENTS AND PRESENTATIONS SECTION OF MSCI'S INVESTOR RELATION."}